    "starting_position": "Set up for Ring Muscle-Up with False Grip in proper position.",
    "setup_instructions": "Prepare body and equipment for Ring Muscle-Up with False Grip.",
    "steps": [
      "Step 1: Hang from rings with false grip (wrist over ring, not under).",
      "Step 2: Pull rings explosively toward chest as if doing a row.",
      "Step 3: As rings reach chest, transition by leaning forward over rings.",
      "Step 4: Press to lockout in a dip to complete the muscle-up."
    ],
